      "status": "not_affected",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-19T23:49:05Z",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_present",
      "impact_statement": "mbedtls_x509_string_to_names() belongs to Mbed TLS's X.509 library (libmbedx509). These images ship only /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libmbedcrypto.so.2.28.3 (a dependency of librist4, via ffmpeg), with no libmbedx509 or libmbedtls, and that library exports no mbedtls_x509_* symbols."
    },
