            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "status": "not_affected",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-19T23:49:05Z",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_present",
      "impact_statement": "The flaw is in PSA_ALG_FFDH key agreement, which Mbed TLS 2.28.3 (libmbedcrypto.so.2.28.3 in these images) does not implement: its psa_key_agreement_raw_internal() supports only PSA_ALG_ECDH, and its legacy DHM module already rejects peer values outside [2, p-2] in dhm_check_range()."
    },
