      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_present",
      "impact_statement": "The flaw is in the TLS 1.3 server code of Mbed TLS 3.5.0 to 3.6.5 and 4.0.0 (libmbedtls). These images ship only libmbedcrypto.so.2.28.3, with no libmbedtls, and it exports no mbedtls_ssl_* symbols."
