      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_present",
      "impact_statement": "The overflow is in FFDH public key export, added in Mbed TLS 3.5.0. These images ship Mbed TLS 2.28.3 (libmbedcrypto.so.2.28.3), whose psa_export_public_key() handles only RSA and ECC keys and has no FFDH key support."
